# Product Audit Truth Standard

Whenever the user says audit, inspect, test, stress test, review the app, or verify completion:

1. Test the real production build and the current working build. Do not infer usability from code, selectors, contracts, or unit tests.
2. Exercise complete human-paced journeys with fresh, returning, migrated, empty, populated, error, offline, and recovery states.
3. Cover web, Companion, loaded extension, injected page Pearl, side panel, Scene, Output Frame, and Pearl Studio where relevant.
4. Test desktop, 390px web, 360px side panel, 200% zoom, keyboard, touch, reduced motion, increased contrast, and screen-reader semantics.
5. Capture screenshots at every meaningful state and manually inspect alignment, typography, spacing, overflow, hierarchy, Pearl rendering, animation, discoverability, and visual clutter.
6. Verify behavior through actual persisted effects, reloads, undo, idempotency, console errors, timings, URLs/logs, and cross-surface state—not screenshots alone.
7. Trace every capability claim to its real runtime handler. Mocked model responses prove wiring only; never present them as live AI evidence.
8. Independently audit adaptive AI prompts, context boundaries, privacy guards, research verification, model/tool routing, failure behavior, and credential-dependent paths.
9. Maintain a severity-ranked defect ledger with reproduction, root cause, expected behavior, fix, regression test, and evidence.
10. Treat any reproduced navigation trap, inaccessible primary action, hidden capability, white-dot fallback, mobile failure, privacy bypass, false success, or broken AI path as release-blocking.
11. State precisely what was not verified because of credentials, permissions, browser restrictions, provider access, or unavailable devices.
12. Never say perfect, complete, production-ready, state of the art, omniscient, or fully working unless direct evidence supports that exact claim.

Release only after all local P0/P1/P2 defects are fixed, screenshots are reviewed, cross-surface parity is proven, the security review is clean, and the full release gate passes.
